OL,3,GNEWSANo further action against man
OL,4,Aarrested after woman, 21, found dead at
OL,5,Aboatyard
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,8,Ffollowing the discovery of a woman's
OL,9,Fbody in a boatyard will face no further
OL,10,Faction.
OL,12,FCorinna Baker, 21, was found at Netpool
OL,13,FBoat Yard in Cardigan, Ceredigion, in
OL,14,FNovember last year.
OL,16,FA 29-year-old man was arrested, but on
OL,17,FWednesday Dyfed-Powys Police said its
OL,18,Finvestigation had ended.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
